    },
    "Tell me about your day, or what's on your mind" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "きょうのできごと・お悩みを どうぞ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write it down, and a fitting great figure will send you a letter of reply with its source" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "書き終えたら、ふさわしい偉人が出典つきの返書を届けます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "e.g. Lately, I can't stop thinking before I fall asleep…" : {
